  "description": "A corked flask two-thirds full of jelly, the fill line sitting flat across the glass with air above it. The glass is pale rather than clear: over a dark panel a transparent bottle is no bottle at all, so the walls carry a little white of their own and the jelly reads as being inside something. Polish: the jelly is a dark base under a lit top instead of one flat gold, the cork has a shaded right side and a full-width ink underlay, and the single gloss on the glass is two pixels wide so it survives 1×. The glass stays at $silent@0.42 — that is the approved read.",
